{"skill":{"slug":"openclaw-find-skills","displayName":"Find Skills"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772609499711,"changelog":"Initial release: discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3574,"sha256":"6895c10c93ec17ca64b2b06ff15cbfa4278e7a011cb9464d9fc4b90a029af71b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1996,"sha256":"7975761130621d29111da10136a9325d1b3166be6d207de7eb3e02ff5c8451a4","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789101627155,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"264dc52a3a2c5b86860090c2694a3603caa8d2d304b88f24c677bddce65d7821","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/264dc52a3a2c5b86860090c2694a3603caa8d2d304b88f24c677bddce65d7821","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780089754247},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":45,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":17,"checkedAt":1789101627155},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is meant to find and install other skills, but it recommends broad triggering plus unpinned, auto-confirmed global installs that can change the user's agent environment.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Global installation and bulk update guidance are not well contained for a discovery helper and lack source verification, version pinning, or a required review checkpoint before environment changes.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The documented workflow repeatedly uses unpinned 'npx skills' commands, installs from GitHub or other sources, and recommends 'npx skills add <owner/repo@skill> -g -y' for global auto-confirmed installation.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The activation description covers broad requests like 'how do I do X' and 'can you do X', which can steer ordinary help requests into skill search or installation flows.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill does not show backdoors, services, credential use, or exfiltration, but global installs and updates can persistently alter the agent's available skills across sessions.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The stated purpose of discovering and installing skills is coherent, but it includes high-impact capability to install third-party skills and update all installed skills.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Review carefully before installing. Prefer a pinned, trusted Skills CLI version, inspect the source skill before adding it, avoid '-g' and '-y' by default, and require explicit confirmation before installing or updating skills that can affect future agent sessions.","findings":"[SQP-1] unexpected: The broad trigger text is artifact-backed and materially over-scoped because common help requests can activate a tool-installation workflow.\n[RP1] expected: Using a skills CLI is expected for this purpose, but the artifact-backed use of unpinned npx commands creates a mutable supply-chain risk, especially when paired with installation and update commands.\n[SQP-2] unexpected: The artifact explicitly recommends global auto-confirmed installation, which removes a meaningful confirmation point for persistent environment changes.\n[EA2] unexpected: The '-y' flag is present in the recommended install command and is not proportionate without a separate explicit user approval and source review step.\n[T08] expected: The static scan's dependency concern is supported by the artifact: external skill installation is purpose-aligned, but the unpinned CLI and unverified third-party sources are under-scoped.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789101627155}}}}}